But if you have not read the comics,
it actually ended in 2019,

00:11:18.944 --> 00:11:21.480
so you can actually read the entire
comic book story.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.748
Now, they won't wind up doing

00:11:22.748 --> 00:11:25.818
everything from the comics
and they will change a bunch of stuff,

00:11:25.818 --> 00:11:28.821
but it is still a really cool story
and it'll give you a pretty good idea

00:11:28.821 --> 00:11:31.290
for some of the stuff
that they'll do in future seasons.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.192
But the big takeaway
is that with each season

00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:35.761
they will continue to escalate
the conflict.

00:11:35.761 --> 00:11:39.031
Things will get bigger, more galactic,
crazier and crazier.

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:42.101
Obviously Season two is just pushing
that into multiverse storytelling,

00:11:42.301 --> 00:11:43.669
but there's a bunch of stuff coming up.

